    "title": "Sweetwater Valley Little League All-Stars advance to West Regional Championship Game - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By City News Service ,\n1 days ago The all-star team from the Sweetwater Valley Little League advanced to Friday's West Regional championship game with a 6-0 victory over its counterpart from Kawaihau Community Little League Tuesday evening in San Bernardino. Isaac Ramirez pitched a one-hitter and went 2-for-2 and scored twice for the Bonita-based Southern California champions... Read full article",
